### Create a task
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "title": "Ma premiere tache",
  "description": "Description de la tache"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("task_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Create a task - validation error (title too short)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "title": "ab",
  "description": "Le titre est trop court"
}

### Create a task - validation error (title missing)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Pas de titre"
}

### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tasks
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get a task by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tasks/{{task_id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get a task - not found
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tasks/unknown-id
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update a task
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tasks/{{task_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "id": "{{task_id}}",
  "title": "Tache mise a jour",
  "description": "Description mise a jour",
  "completed": true
}

### Update a task - validation error (title blank)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tasks/{{task_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "id": "{{task_id}}",
  "title": "",
  "description": "Le titre est vide",
  "completed": false
}

### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/tasks/{{task_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Access tasks without token (should return 403)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tasks
Accept: application/json
